                            "Q2 guidance of $19.5–21.5B and non-GAAP EPS of $1.66–1.90 means even the low end comes to about $6.6 a year, roughly 3x the share price.",
                            "Management says it was among the first to ship Nvidia Vera Rubin NVL72 racks, which shows its speed-to-market edge still works.",
